    "/admin/v1/providers/{id}/force-run": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Provider"
        ],
        "summary": "Provider - Force Run",
        "description": "Sets force_run=true. The feed:dispatch scheduler picks it up on the next tick (~1 min). Returns 202 — the run is not immediate.",
        "operationId": "8d1bbfbe380107703ab11044bb0bc987",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Accepted — dispatcher will pick up shortly. Asynchronous, in contrast to schema/init which is synchronous.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "properties": {
                            "force_run_scheduled": {
                              "type": "boolean",
                              "example": true
                            }
                          },
                          "type": "object"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/providers/{id}/schema/init": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Provider"
        ],
        "summary": "Provider - Init Schema",
        "description": "Runs SchemaAutoMapper against the first <capture_node> in a feed sample. Returns the suggested mapping. Pass `{\"save\": true}` to also persist it into sponsor.job_provider.schema_mapping. HTTP mirror of the `php spark feed:init <id> [--save]` command.\n\n─── Cached-sample behavior (default) ─────────────────────────\nBy default this endpoint REUSES the most recent locally-cached XML file for the provider if one exists and is under `max_age_hours` old (default 24h). This keeps iterative \"adjust capture_node → re-init → adjust → re-init\" workflows from burning a fresh download every time. If no cached file exists or the file is too old, falls through to a fresh fetch automatically.\n\nPass `{\"force_download\": true}` to skip the cache and always fetch fresh. The response includes `used_cached_file` so the SPA can surface which path ran.\n\n─── Timing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────\nSynchronous. Cached-sample path returns in seconds (parse-only). Fresh-fetch path can run 30-120s depending on feed size — surface a loading state in the SPA when force_download or when no cache exists yet.\n\n─── Warnings (READ THESE) ──────────────────────────────────\nThe response includes a `warnings` array of advisory strings. Each one means a field will be missing or wrong after ingest:\n  • a mapping landed at \"suggested\" confidence — the transform step SKIPS those, so the field is empty on every document\n  • a required target (jobid, title, description, joburl, company, city, state, date_posted) has no source at all\n  • the sample contains a self-nested element, which is unsafe to use as capture_node\nSurface these prominently in the SPA — an empty array is the \"good to process\" signal. Warnings are advisory and are NOT persisted into schema_mapping when save=true.\n\n─── Failure modes ──────────────────────────────────────────\n404 (provider not found), 422 (no feed_url configured), 502 (fetch or parse failed — check feed log for details).",
        "operationId": "90030c1bfc8edc849cd00c2bf47cd00d",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": false,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "save": {
                    "description": "Persist the mapping to sponsor.job_provider.schema_mapping.",
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "force_download": {
                    "description": "Skip the local-cache check and always re-fetch. Use when the feed content has changed but the cache is still fresh.",
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "max_age_hours": {
                    "description": "Max age (hours) for the cached XML file to be usable. Ignored when force_download=true.",
                    "type": "integer",
                    "default": 24
                  }
                },
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Mapping generated. Synchronous — the response includes the suggested mapping directly. NOTE: 200 not 202 (unlike force-run, which is async).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "properties": {
                            "suggested_mapping": {
                              "description": "Field-to-source map inferred from the feed sample.",
                              "type": "object"
                            },
                            "saved": {
                              "description": "True iff save=true was passed AND the DB write succeeded.",
                              "type": "boolean"
                            },
                            "used_cached_file": {
                              "description": "True when the fresh-fetch path was skipped in favor of a cached XML sample.",
                              "type": "boolean"
                            },
                            "warnings": {
                              "description": "Empty = \"good to process\". Non-empty rows describe fields that will be missing or wrong after ingest.",
                              "type": "array",
                              "items": {
                                "type": "string"
                              }
                            },
                            "save_error": {
                              "description": "Present only when save=true but the DB write failed. Mapping still returned so the caller can retry the save.",
                              "type": "string"
                            }
                          },
                          "type": "object"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Provider not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Provider has no feed_url configured.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "Feed fetch or XML parse failed.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/providers/{id}/activate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Provider"
        ],
        "summary": "Provider - Activate",
        "description": "Reactivates a provider that was soft-deactivated via DELETE — sets active=true. The inverse of DELETE /providers/{id}. Kept as a dedicated action (not PATCH) so the deactivate/reactivate pair stays out of config-edit audit noise. Takes ~2 minutes to affect live search (cache refresh cadence). Note: this does NOT touch `paused` — a provider that was paused before deactivation comes back still paused; resume it separately if needed.",
        "operationId": "e19ff8c34e298256a1687da5048160f5",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Reactivated provider (detail shape).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "allOf": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Provider"
                            },
                            {
                              "properties": {
                                "schema_mapping": {
                                  "type": "object",
                                  "nullable": true
                                },
                                "campaign_count": {
                                  "type": "integer"
                                },
                                "username_set": {
                                  "type": "boolean"
                                },
                                "password_set": {
                                  "type": "boolean"
                                },
                                "latest_run": {
                                  "oneOf": [
                                    {
                                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RunInfo"
                                    }
                                  ],
                                  "nullable": true
                                }
                              },
                              "type": "object"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/publishers/{id}/accounts": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - List",
        "description": "Returns prefix + hint (never plaintext or hash). Unpaginated — a publisher typically has a small number of keys (rotate + revoke pattern).",
        "operationId": "07005add1dbb5705ae2d91d1457fef5b",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "sort",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "account_name",
                "date_created",
                "date_last_used",
                "active"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "direction",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "default": "desc",
              "enum": [
                "asc",
                "desc"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Accounts list (unpaginated — small per publisher).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Publisher not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Create",
        "description": "Generates a fresh key via PublisherAccountManager, INSERTs the hash + prefix + hint into publisher_account, and returns the plaintext IN THE RESPONSE BODY exactly once. The plaintext is unrecoverable after this call — the SPA MUST force a \"copy this key\" confirmation step before the modal closes. Body: account_name*, cpc_share (default 0.7000), rate_limit_tier (default 'default'), organic (default false).",
        "operationId": "12c20d0f82c664127037e7a6fbab09c4",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "properties": {
                  "account_name": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "maxLength": 255
                  },
                  "cpc_share": {
                    "type": "number",
                    "format": "float",
                    "default": 0.7,
                    "maximum": 1,
                    "minimum": 0
                  },
                  "rate_limit_tier": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "default": "default",
                    "maxLength": 32
                  },
                  "organic": {
                    "description": "Mix unpaid / organic inventory into this account's search results (below paid). Default false.",
                    "type": "boolean",
                    "default": false
                  },
                  "min_payout": {
                    "description": "Minimum NET payout (effective_cpc x cpc_share) this account earns on a served paid job. Paid jobs below it are not served to this account on the live search API; organic backfill is unaffected. Null / omitted = no floor.",
                    "type": "number",
                    "format": "float",
                    "nullable": true,
                    "minimum": 0
                  }
                },
                "type": "object"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Created. `data.api_key_plaintext` is returned EXACTLY ONCE — unrecoverable after this response. `data.warning` explains this to the user.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "allOf": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                            },
                            {
                              "properties": {
                                "api_key_plaintext": {
                                  "description": "The full plaintext key. Returned once, never again. Store immediately.",
                                  "type": "string"
                                },
                                "warning": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              },
                              "type": "object"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Publisher not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation failure.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/accounts/{account_id}": {
      "patch": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Update",
        "description": "Mutable: account_name, cpc_share, rate_limit_tier, organic, min_payout (number = net payout floor for live serving; null clears it). The key material itself is immutable — rotate by revoking and issuing new.",
        "operationId": "fff54f28fa1d8fd106d669b3d465f0bf",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Updated account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Account not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/accounts/{account_id}/revoke": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Revoke",
        "description": "Sets active=false. PublisherAuth denies the key on the very next request — no cache warmup delay because the auth check is a per-request DB lookup. Historical clicks attributed to this account keep their FK.",
        "operationId": "0322f6b95002d6f420e61d7b0c1d46b4",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Revoked account (active=false).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Account not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/accounts/{account_id}/regenerate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Regenerate Key",
        "description": "Rotates key material IN PLACE on the same publisher_account row. Same semantics as the self-serve /publisher/v1/api-keys/{id}/regenerate — account (name, cpc_share, tier, historical click attribution) preserved; prefix/hash/hint replaced. Old key stops authenticating IMMEDIATELY. Plaintext returned EXACTLY ONCE. Admin-initiated rotations log actor_type='admin' on publisher.publisher_key_rotation.",
        "operationId": "5b156616af43993e1f9784b5f3e30845",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Rotated. `data.api_key_plaintext` is returned exactly once.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "allOf": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                            },
                            {
                              "properties": {
                                "api_key_plaintext": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                },
                                "warning": {
                                  "type": "string"
                                }
                              },
                              "type": "object"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Account not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Prefix collision on generation (pathologically rare).",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/accounts/{account_id}/rotations": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Rotation History",
        "description": "Paginated list of every rotate/revoke/reactivate/expire event on this account, newest first. Each row includes `actor_display` — the human-readable \"First Last (username)\" of the admin or publisher-login who initiated it, or \"system\" for automated events.",
        "operationId": "c2a2ef4eb1ceb944ebf2c41bf799094a",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "page",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 1
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "per_page",
            "in": "query",
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer",
              "default": 50,
              "maximum": 200
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Paginated rotation history.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "type": "array",
                          "items": {
                            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherKeyRotation"
                          }
                        },
                        "meta": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PaginationMeta"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Account not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/admin/v1/accounts/{account_id}/reactivate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Publisher Account"
        ],
        "summary": "Publisher Account - Reactivate",
        "description": "Flips active=true on a previously-revoked account. Admin-only — publishers cannot self-serve reactivate (a revoked key is off for a reason). PublisherAuth starts accepting the key again immediately (next request lookup returns active=true). Logs actor_type='admin' on publisher.publisher_key_rotation.",
        "operationId": "462b77000f5ee53b8bd0fd812abc379f",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "account_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Reactivated account.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "data": {
                          "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PublisherAccount"
                        }
                      },
                      "type": "object"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Account not found.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JsonEnvelope"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
