        "description": "Paginated. Filters: q (substring against name), active. `Sponsor` = the parent org that owns Providers — every Provider row carries `job_partner_id` FK to this table. UI-facing term is \"Sponsor\"; the underlying table is sponsor.job_partner for historical reasons (predates the sponsor schema).",
